{
  "info": {
    "name": "IOES - Question Bank API (Full)",
    "description": "Postman collection đầy đủ cho Question Bank module.\n\n## Features Tested\n- CRUD Questions (MCQ, True/False, Coding, Short Answer, Essay)\n- Topic Tree & Practice Path\n- Similar Questions (Vector similarity)\n- Bulk Import (CSV/Excel)\n- Image Upload (Presigned URL)\n- Admin Operations (Resync, Storage Health)\n- Dgraph Sync (CQRS Pattern)\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `GATEWAY_URL` = http://localhost:8080 (hoặc 9005 nếu test trực tiếp)\n2. Login và set `TOKEN`\n3. Chạy test theo thứ tự",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "GATEWAY_URL",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOKEN",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUESTION_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "TOPIC_ID",
      "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "SKILL_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "PREREQUISITE_Q_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "BULK_JOB_ID",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{TOKEN}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00.1 Login - Student",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('TOKEN', jsonData.data.accessToken);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(jsonData.data.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"student@ioes.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Test@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{GATEWAY_URL}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{GATEWAY_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "00.2 Login - Instructor",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
